📊 Social Media Data Analysis

📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing social media data using Python and data visualization techniques. It helps understand post performance and audience engagement.

🎯 Project Objectives

- Analyze social media performance.
- Compare different post types.
- Understand audience engagement.
- Visualize data through graphs and charts.

🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Streamlit
- Visual Studio Code

📈 Key Features

- Social Media Data Analysis
- Post Type Wise Average Likes
- Data Visualization
- Interactive Dashboard
- Performance Analysis

🔍 Project Workflow

1. Data Collection
2. Data Processing
3. Data Analysis
4. Data Visualization
5. Dashboard Development

🚀 Future Scope

- AI-Based Performance Prediction
- Sentiment Analysis
- Real-Time Social Media Data
- Advanced Interactive Dashboard
- Social Media Platform Comparison

